  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Western Hemisphere Regional Migration Capacity-Building Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the programme is to strengthen the capacities of governments and other key stakeholders to improve migration governance and facilitate safe, orderly and regular migration while reducing migrant vulnerabilities. In accordance with the IOM Strategic Vision and the IOM Regional Strategy 2020 - 2024 for North America, Central America and the Caribbean, the programme provides an integrated capacity-building approach for program countries which will contribute to the achievement of migration management; partnerships; crisis response and communication.</narrative>
  </description>
